## About LugalOS
=> /help/about.gmi Architectural Overview & Philosophy
LugalOS is a lightweight, capability-based operating system designed for RISC-V microcontrollers and display terminals.
Zero permanent SRAM footprint, pure fixed-point mathematics, and native Plan 9 / Gemini / Spartan network capabilities.
